invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: webpki_takes_tickets answers 1 for every configuration, so every init
  call hashes the anchors, whether or not the session takes tickets
  (docs/decisions.md 132). test/webpki_ticket_rows.h's row without
  on_ticket counts one hash where it requires none.

--- old
    return cfg->on_ticket != NULL;
--- new
    (void)cfg;
    return 1;
